+    * VertexIn struct and at its [[attribute(n)]] index, so the vertex
+    * descriptor has to be filled at that same location.  Compacting the
+    * attributes here - which the shader-lowered path does, because it indexes
+    * its own descriptor array - instead left Metal matching each declared
+    * attribute against another one's format, or against nothing at all:
+    * "attribute_5(5) is missing from the vertex descriptor". */
